{"id":"3d403afbc05692a5","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-set9-closed-under-replacement-image.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Closed Under Replacement Image","display":"df-zfc-set9-closed-under-replacement-image — ZFC Set9 Closed Under Replacement Image","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-closed-under-replacement-image","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-closed-under-replacement-image"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-closed-under-replacement-image — ZFC Set9 Closed Under Replacement Image","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-closed-under-replacement-image"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-closed-under-replacement-image</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-closed-under-replacement-image — ZFC Set9 Closed Under Replacement Image"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (collection candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (set-coded relation candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F[x]=\\{v:\\exists u\\in x\\;(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in F)\\}\">\\(F[x]=\\{v:\\exists u\\in x\\;(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in F)\\}\\)</span> (relational image)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9ClosedUnderReplacementImage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9ClosedUnderReplacementImage}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}replacement\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9ClosedUnderReplacementImage}_S(A,F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\bigcup A,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\;\n\\left(\n\\{v:\\exists u\\in x\\;(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in F)\\}\\in A\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}replacement\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9ClosedUnderReplacementImage}_S(A,F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\bigcup A,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\;\n\\left(\n\\{v:\\exists u\\in x\\;(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in F)\\}\\in A\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closure is now guarded by total single-valuedness on every possible member of an input set, so the displayed image is a genuine replacement image.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","an